      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e  Is it because the overflow addition forces the MCU to reboot??\n\nYep, exactly. The [`test_ftrapv_addition` test is testing `__addvsi3`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/test/ftrapv.c;l\u003d14-16;drc\u003da147fd5e333e940ff831cd09964ca855b3f78755), which is a \"trapping arithmetic function\". See section 4.1.3 [here](https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gccint/Integer-library-routines.html).\n\nWe have [made `abort()` reboot the FPMCU](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/libc/syscalls.c;l\u003d24-35;drc\u003d12e2abf6abad06b572a18af832afc33140a8207b).",
